 entitled to a meal voucher?":["umbuchen",28.077,2.219,30.646,3.029],"Could you write that down for me?":["umbuchen",34.025,1.707,36.082,2.56],"I'd rather not wait until tomorrow.":["umbuchen",38.992,2.176,41.518,3.051],"Good afternoon. How can I help you?":["umbuchen",44.919,2.176,47.445,3.051],"Hello. I've missed my connecting flight to Edinburgh. My flight from Frankfurt was delayed.":["umbuchen",50.845,5.013,56.209,7.019],"I'm sorry about that. Let me have a look. The next available flight leaves at eight fifteen this evening.":["umbuchen",63.577,5.717,69.645,8.256],"That's quite late. Is there an earlier option, perhaps with another airline?":["umbuchen",78.251,4.096,82.697,5.675],"There's a flight at five, but it's fully booked. I can put you on the waiting list, if you like.":["umbuchen",88.721,4.757,93.829,6.763],"Yes, please. And will my luggage be transferred automatically?":["umbuchen",100.941,3.392,104.683,4.779],"Yes, it will go on the same flight as you. Here's a voucher for a meal while you wait.":["umbuchen",109.812,4.501,114.663,6.464],"That's very kind. Could you write down the flight number for me?":["umbuchen",121.477,3.371,125.198,4.757],"Of course. It's BA 1447, departing from gate thirty-two.":["umbuchen",130.305,5.461,136.117,7.701],"The flight is fully booked, I'm afraid.":["umbuchen",144.168,2.475,146.993,3.413],"Could you put me on the waiting list, please?":["umbuchen",150.756,2.155],"Would you like a meal voucher?":["umbuchen",153.261,1.877,155.488,2.645],"Yes, please. That's very kind of you.":["umbuchen",158.483,2.027],"Is there anything else I can do for you?":["umbuchen",160.86,2.389,163.599,3.264],"No, thank you. You've been very helpful.":["umbuchen",167.213,2.155],"I'm afraid there's a problem with my room.":["hotelproblem",0.3,2.304,2.954,3.285],"The heating doesn't seem to be working.":["hotelproblem",6.589,2.133,9.073,2.965],"I asked for a quiet room.":["hotelproblem",12.388,1.792,14.53,2.475],"Would it be possible to move to another room?":["hotelproblem",17.355,2.219,19.923,3.221],"I'd appreciate it if you could look into it.":["hotelproblem",23.495,2.304,26.149,3.285],"Is breakfast included in the price?":["hotelproblem",29.784,2.091,32.225,3.008],"Could I have a late check-out?":["hotelproblem",35.583,1.856,37.789,2.624],"Could you call a taxi for me tomorrow morning?":["hotelproblem",40.763,2.325,43.438,3.371],"Good evening, madam. Is everything all right with your room?":["hotelproblem",47.159,3.819,51.327,5.355],"Actually, I'm afraid there's a problem. The heating doesn't seem to be working, and it's rather cold.":["hotelproblem",57.032,5.227,62.609,7.317],"Oh dear, I'm very sorry. I'll send someone up straight away.":["hotelproblem",70.276,4.011,74.637,5.568],"Thank you. Also, I asked for a quiet room, but my window faces the main road.":["hotelproblem",80.555,4.459,85.363,6.101],"I see. Would you like to move? We have a room at the back, overlooking the garden.":["hotelproblem",91.815,4.736,96.901,6.72],"That would be lovely. Would it be possible to move this evening?":["hotelproblem",103.971,3.221,107.542,4.629],"Of course. And as an apology, breakfast tomorrow is on us.":["hotelproblem",112.521,4.075,116.946,5.568],"That's very generous of you. Thank you so much.":["hotelproblem",122.864,2.624,125.838,3.712],"Is everything all right with your room?":["hotelproblem",129.9,2.624,132.874,3.691],"I'm afraid there's a problem with the heating.":["hotelproblem",136.915,2.24],"Would you like to move to another room?":["hotelproblem",139.505,2.453,142.308,3.499],"Yes, that would be lovely.":["hotelproblem",146.157,1.536],"What time would you like the taxi?":["hotelproblem",148.043,2.325,150.718,3.285],"At half past seven, please.":["hotelproblem",154.353,1.813],"Could we have a table by the window?":["essengehen",0.3,1.899,2.549,2.773],"What would you recommend?":["essengehen",5.672,1.451,7.473,2.112],"Does this dish contain nuts?":["essengehen",9.935,1.792,12.077,2.624],"My friend is allergic to nuts.":["essengehen",15.051,1.984,17.385,2.88],"Could I have the sauce on the side?":["essengehen",20.615,1.963,22.927,2.731],"I'll have the same, please.":["essengehen",26.008,1.6,27.958,2.325],"Could we have the bill, please?":["essengehen",30.633,1.685,32.669,2.432],"Is service included?":["essengehen",35.451,1.493,37.294,2.176],"Good evening, ladies. Are you ready to order?":["essengehen",39.82,2.923,43.093,4.16],"Almost. What would you recommend today?":["essengehen",47.603,2.069,50.022,2.859],"The lamb is excellent, and we also have fresh sea bass from the coast.":["essengehen",53.231,4.48,58.061,6.208],"The sea bass sounds lovely. Does it contain any nuts? My friend is allergic.":["essengehen",64.619,4.501,69.47,6.528],"The sauce has almonds in it, but we can serve it without the sauce.":["essengehen",76.348,4.117,80.815,5.547],"Perfect. Then two sea bass, one without the sauce, and a bottle of white wine.":["essengehen",86.712,3.968,91.03,5.504],"Very good. Would you like any starters?":["essengehen",96.884,2.603,99.837,3.648],"No, thank you. We'll save some room for dessert.":["essengehen",103.835,2.688,106.873,3.904],"What would you recommend today?":["essengehen",111.127,1.643],"Are you ready to order?":["essengehen",113.119,1.643,115.112,2.261],"Almost. What would you recommend?":["essengehen",117.723,1.835],"How was everything?":["essengehen",119.908,1.429,121.687,2.048],"Delicious, thank you. Compliments to the chef!":["essengehen",124.085,2.517],"Would you like to see the dessert menu?":["essengehen",126.953,2.603,129.905,3.669],"Yes, please. We saved some room!":["essengehen",133.925,1.899],"I'm interested in the day trip to the Lake District.":["tagestour",0.3,2.709,3.359,3.797],"What does the price include?":["tagestour",7.507,1.728,9.585,2.389],"How much walking is involved?":["tagestour",12.324,1.856,14.53,2.645],"Is lunch included?":["tagestour",17.525,1.408,19.283,2.069],"What time do we get back?":["tagestour",21.703,1.6,23.653,2.155],"Is there a discount for pensioners?":["tagestour",26.157,2.027,28.534,2.88],"Where exactly is the pick-up point?":["tagestour",31.764,2.133,34.247,3.029],"What happens if it rains?":["tagestour",37.627,1.707,39.683,2.432],"Hello! Can I help you?":["tagestour",42.465,1.685,44.501,2.347],"Yes, I'm interested in the day trip to the Lake District on Thursday. What does the price include?":["tagestour",47.197,5.333,52.881,7.509],"The coach, a guided boat trip on Lake Windermere and afternoon tea. Lunch isn't included, but there's plenty of time to eat in Ambleside.":["tagestour",60.74,8.32,69.41,11.563],"How much walking is involved? I'm not very good on steep paths.":["tagestour",81.323,3.669,85.342,4.885],"Hardly any. There's an optional walk, but you can stay in the village instead.":["tagestour",90.577,4.224,95.151,6.08],"That sounds ideal. Is there a discount for pensioners?":["tagestour",101.581,3.179,105.11,4.437],"Yes, it's fifty-five pounds instead of sixty-five. The coach leaves from the station at eight and gets back at around six.":["tagestour",109.897,6.827,117.074,9.536],"And what happens if it rains?":["tagestour",126.96,1.856,129.166,2.667],"The trip goes ahead anyway. It's the Lake District – it usually rains!":["tagestour",132.183,4.096,136.629,5.803],"The trip goes ahead anyway.":["tagestour",142.781,1.813],"Would you like to book the trip?":["tagestour",144.945,1.771,147.065,2.517],"Yes, please. One ticket for Thursday.":["tagestour",149.933,2.155],"Do you have any other questions?":["tagestour",152.437,1.877,154.665,2.709],"Yes – where exactly is the pick-up point?":["tagestour",157.724,2.389],"The coach leaves at eight o'clock sharp.":["tagestour",160.463,2.283,163.096,3.243],"Fine, I'll be there at a quarter to eight.":["tagestour",166.689,2.304],"I'd like to make an appointment, please.":["arzt",0.3,2.048,2.698,2.944],"I've had a sore throat since Monday.":["arzt",5.992,2.005,8.347,2.837],"I feel dizzy when I stand up.":["arzt",11.535,1.877,13.762,2.752],"I take tablets for my blood pressure.":["arzt",16.864,2.197,19.411,3.115],"Is it anything serious?":["arzt",22.876,1.621,24.847,2.432],"How often should I take them?":["arzt",27.629,1.749,29.729,2.56],"Do I need a prescription?":["arzt",32.639,1.621,34.61,2.261],"Could I have a receipt for my insurance?":["arzt",37.221,2.24,39.811,3.093],"Good morning. What seems to be the problem?":["arzt",43.255,2.688,46.293,3.733],"I've had a sore throat since Monday, and now I've got a temperature as well.":["arzt",50.376,3.968,54.694,5.589],"Let me have a look. Yes, your throat is quite red. Are you taking any other medication?":["arzt",60.633,5.675,66.658,8.0],"Yes, I take tablets for my blood pressure every morning.":["arzt",75.008,3.072,78.43,4.331],"That's fine. It's a throat infection – nothing serious. I'll give you a prescription for some antibiotics.":["arzt",83.111,6.827,90.287,9.365],"Three times a day, after meals, for five days. And drink plenty of fluids.":["arzt",100.003,5.163,105.515,7.168],"Thank you, doctor. Could I have a receipt for my insurance?":["arzt",113.033,3.392,116.775,4.693],"Of course. The receptionist will give you one on your way out.":["arzt",121.819,4.117,126.286,5.76],"What seems to be the problem?":["arzt",132.396,1.963,134.709,2.709],"Are you taking any other medication?":["arzt",137.768,2.624,140.742,3.691],"Yes, tablets for my blood pressure.":["arzt",144.783,2.069],"Take these three times a day.":["arzt",147.202,2.197,149.749,3.115],"Should I take them before or after meals?":["arzt",153.214,2.432],"The train has been cancelled.":["zugausfall",0.3,1.771,2.421,2.496],"How else can I get to York?":["zugausfall",5.267,1.771,7.387,2.56],"Is my ticket still valid?":["zugausfall",10.297,1.813,12.461,2.581],"Do I have to change trains?":["zugausfall",15.392,1.749,17.491,2.56],"Which platform does it leave from?":["zugausfall",20.401,1.877,22.629,2.645],"Is there a replacement bus service?":["zugausfall",25.624,1.984,27.958,2.944],"Can I get a refund?":["zugausfall",31.252,1.472,33.074,2.112],"Excuse me, is this seat taken?":["zugausfall",35.536,2.005,37.891,2.859],"Excuse me, the board says the ten fifteen to York has been cancelled. How else can I get there?":["zugausfall",41.1,5.312,46.762,7.509],"I'm sorry, there's a problem with the signals. You can take the ten forty to Leeds and change there.":["zugausfall",54.621,5.312,60.283,7.531],"Is my ticket still valid on that train?":["zugausfall",68.164,2.304,70.818,3.264],"Yes, all tickets are valid today on any route to York.":["zugausfall",74.432,3.136,77.918,4.501],"Good. Which platform does it leave from?":["zugausfall",82.769,1.963,85.082,2.944],"Platform seven. You'll have about ten minutes in Leeds to catch your connection.":["zugausfall",88.376,4.267,92.993,5.973],"And what if I miss it?":["zugausfall",99.316,1.579,101.245,2.197],"There's a train every half hour. And because of the delay, you can claim a partial refund online.":["zugausfall",103.792,5.248,109.39,7.467],"Tickets, please!":["zugausfall",117.207,1.387,118.943,1.984],"Here you are. Is this the right train for York?":["zugausfall",121.277,2.539],"Is this seat taken?":["zugausfall",124.166,1.6,126.116,2.283],"No, please go ahead.":["zugausfall",128.749,1.579],"You'll need to change in Leeds.":["zugausfall",130.677,1.941,132.969,2.709],"How long do I have to catch my connection?":["zugausfall",136.028,2.411],"I bought this jumper here yesterday.":["umtausch",0.3,2.133,2.783,3.072],"It's a bit too tight.":["umtausch",6.205,1.429,7.985,2.133],"Could I exchange it for a larger size?":["umtausch",10.468,2.347,13.165,3.349],"I've still got the receipt.":["umtausch",16.864,1.664,18.878,2.389],"There's a small hole in the sleeve.":["umtausch",21.617,1.877,23.845,2.709],"I'd prefer a refund, if that's possible.":["umtausch",26.904,2.347,29.601,3.371],"Could you check if you have it in another colour?":["umtausch",33.321,2.24,35.911,3.243],"I'll take the blue one instead.":["umtausch",39.504,1.856,41.71,2.581],"Hello. I bought this jumper here yesterday, but unfortunately it's a bit too tight.":["umtausch",44.641,4.544,49.535,6.187],"Oh, I'm sorry. Have you got the receipt?":["umtausch",56.072,2.368,58.79,3.243],"Yes, here it is. Could I exchange it for a larger size?":["umtausch",62.383,3.605,66.338,5.099],"Let me check. I'm afraid we haven't got a large in grey. We've only got it in blue or dark green.":["umtausch",71.787,5.44,77.577,7.552],"Hmm. Could I see the blue one?":["umtausch",85.479,1.792,87.621,2.453],"Here you are. The colour really suits you, actually.":["umtausch",90.424,2.795,93.569,3.883],"Do you think so? All right, I'll take the blue one instead.":["umtausch",97.801,2.901,101.053,4.032],"Lovely. There's no extra charge – it's the same price.":["umtausch",105.435,3.179,108.963,4.459],"The colour really suits you.":["umtausch",113.772,1.6],"Have you got the receipt?":["umtausch",115.722,1.643,117.715,2.261],"Yes, here it is.":["umtausch",120.326,1.301],"Would you like a refund or an exchange?":["umtausch",121.977,2.475,124.802,3.456],"An exchange, please – one size larger.":["umtausch",128.608,2.453],"That colour really suits you!":["umtausch",131.411,1.877,133.639,2.645],"Do you think so? Thank you!":["umtausch",136.634,1.579],"Have you been here before?":["reisebekannte",0.3,1.536,2.186,2.24],"It's my first time in Cornwall.":["reisebekannte",4.776,1.984,7.11,2.773],"I've been to London twice.":["reisebekannte",10.233,1.749,12.333,2.581],"I used to work in an office.":["reisebekannte",15.264,1.749,17.363,2.453],"I've been learning English for a few months.":["reisebekannte",20.167,2.069,22.586,2.923],"How long are you staying this time?":["reisebekannte",25.859,1.941,28.15,2.709],"It's been lovely talking to you.":["reisebekannte",31.209,1.813,33.373,2.624],"Enjoy the rest of your stay!":["reisebekannte",36.347,1.728,38.425,2.517],"Lovely view, isn't it? Have you been here before?":["reisebekannte",41.292,3.285,44.927,4.48],"No, it's my first time in Cornwall. But I've been to London twice.":["reisebekannte",49.757,3.904,54.011,5.333],"Your English is very good. Where are you from?":["reisebekannte",59.695,3.072,63.117,4.224],"Thank you! I'm from Germany. I've been learning English again for a few months.":["reisebekannte",67.691,4.224,72.265,5.973],"Well, it shows. My wife and I come here every year. We used to come with our children, but now they're grown up.":["reisebekannte",78.588,7.168,86.106,9.813],"How lovely. How long are you staying this time?":["reisebekannte",96.269,2.475,99.094,3.371],"Two weeks. Have you tried the cream tea in the village yet? It's the best in Cornwall.":["reisebekannte",102.815,5.269,108.434,7.317],"Not yet, but I will! It's been lovely talking to you.":["reisebekannte",116.101,2.923,119.374,4.181],"Likewise. Enjoy the rest of your stay!":["reisebekannte",123.905,2.709,126.965,3.797],"We used to come with our children.":["reisebekannte",131.112,1.792],"No, this is my first time.":["reisebekannte",133.254,1.856],"Likewise! Enjoy the rest of your stay.":["reisebekannte",135.46,2.261],"Have you tried the cream tea yet?":["reisebekannte",138.071,2.304,140.725,3.136],"Not yet, but I'd love to.":["reisebekannte",144.211,1.685],"When I was young, we didn't travel much.":["erinnerungen",0.3,2.155,2.805,2.965],"My first trip abroad was to Italy in 1972.":["erinnerungen",6.12,4.032,10.502,5.696],"We were driving through the Alps when the car broke down.":["erinnerungen",16.548,2.709,19.607,3.691],"I'll never forget the view.":["erinnerungen",23.648,1.579,25.577,2.261],"It was a long time ago, but I remember it well.":["erinnerungen",28.188,2.539,31.077,3.691],"In those days, everything was different.":["erinnerungen",35.117,2.304,37.771,3.221],"What happened next?":["erinnerungen",41.343,1.365,43.058,1.963],"That reminds me of something.":["erinnerungen",45.371,1.664,47.385,2.347],"My first trip abroad was to France, in 1968. We went by ferry. What about you?":["erinnerungen",50.081,6.443,56.874,8.939],"Mine was to Italy, in 1972. We went by car with my parents.":["erinnerungen",66.163,5.205,71.718,7.125],"By car! That must have been quite an adventure.":["erinnerungen",79.193,2.709,82.253,3.669],"Oh yes. We were driving through the Alps when the car suddenly broke down.":["erinnerungen",86.272,3.691,90.313,5.035],"Oh dear! What happened next?":["erinnerungen",95.697,1.941,97.989,2.667],"A farmer stopped and towed us to the next village. We stayed there for three days while they repaired it.":["erinnerungen",101.005,5.355,106.71,7.488],"Three days in a mountain village – that sounds rather lovely, actually.":["erinnerungen",114.548,4.011,118.909,5.675],"It was! I'll never forget the view from our little guesthouse.":["erinnerungen",124.933,3.008,128.291,4.16],"Our car broke down in the middle of nowhere.":["erinnerungen",132.801,2.475,135.626,3.477],"Oh no! What did you do?":["erinnerungen",139.453,1.621],"Where did you go on your first holiday abroad?":["erinnerungen",141.425,2.688,144.463,3.605],"We went to Italy, by car.":["erinnerungen",148.418,1.749],"That reminds me of my honeymoon.":["erinnerungen",150.517,2.112,152.979,2.901],"Really? Where did you go?":["erinnerungen",156.231,1.6],"In my opinion, it's a good idea.":["meinung",0.3,2.112,2.762,3.072],"I see your point, but …":["meinung",6.184,1.536,8.07,2.133],"I'm not so sure about that.":["meinung",10.553,1.877,12.781,2.603],"I couldn't agree more.":["meinung",15.733,1.429,17.513,2.027],"That's true, but on the other hand …":["meinung",19.889,1.941,22.181,2.795],"What worries me is the parking.":["meinung",25.325,1.835,27.51,2.645],"It depends on how it's organised.":["meinung",30.505,1.941,32.797,2.795],"Let's agree to disagree.":["meinung",35.941,1.685,37.977,2.325],"Personally, I think closing the high street to cars is a brilliant idea. It'll be so much quieter.":["meinung",40.652,6.784,47.786,9.365],"I see your point, but I'm not so sure. What worries me is how older people will get to the shops.":["meinung",57.501,5.269,63.121,7.381],"That's a fair point. But there'll be a shuttle bus every ten minutes.":["meinung",70.852,4.288,75.49,5.995],"That's true, but on the other hand, the nearest bus stop is quite far from my house.":["meinung",81.835,4.523,86.707,6.144],"Hmm, I hadn't thought of that. Maybe they could add another stop.":["meinung",93.201,4.096,97.647,5.589],"That would help a lot. In my opinion, it depends on how it's organised.":["meinung",103.587,4.181,108.118,5.909],"Well, let's suggest it at the next meeting.":["meinung",114.377,2.901,117.629,3.861],"Good idea. I couldn't agree more!":["meinung",121.84,1.899,124.089,2.731],"I think everybody should stop driving.":["meinung",127.169,2.539,130.058,3.541],"I see your point, but that's not always possible.":["meinung",133.949,2.624],"Don't you think the new park is wonderful?":["meinung",136.923,2.688,139.961,3.691],"Absolutely – I couldn't agree more.":["meinung",144.002,2.005],"What do you think about it?":["meinung",146.357,1.515,148.222,1.984],"Honestly, I'm not so sure. It depends.":["meinung",150.556,2.347],"How many grandchildren have you got?":["enkel",0.3,2.048,2.698,2.795],"She's just started university.":["enkel",5.843,2.027,8.219,2.88],"They grow up so fast.":["enkel",11.449,1.621,13.421,2.411],"We keep in touch by video call.":["enkel",16.181,2.027,18.558,2.901],"Things have changed a lot since we were young.":["enkel",21.809,2.24,24.399,3.136],"I've never been on social media.":["enkel",27.885,1.984,30.219,2.901],"He takes after his grandfather.":["enkel",33.471,1.941,35.762,2.752],"We get on very well.":["enkel",38.864,1.451,40.665,2.112],"This is my granddaughter, Lucy. She's just started university in Manchester.":["enkel",43.127,4.544,48.021,6.421],"She looks lovely! They grow up so fast, don't they?":["enkel",54.792,2.667,57.809,3.669],"They really do. How many grandchildren have you got?":["enkel",61.828,3.051,65.229,4.309],"I've got two. They live quite far away, so we keep in touch by video call.":["enkel",69.888,3.968,74.206,5.44],"Video calls! Things have changed a lot since we were young, haven't they?":["enkel",79.996,3.733,84.079,5.141],"Absolutely. When I was a child, we didn't even have a telephone at home.":["enkel",89.571,3.819,93.739,5.333],"Neither did we! We used to write letters. Does your grandson look like you?":["enkel",99.423,4.181,103.954,5.888],"Not really – he takes after his grandfather. But we get on very well.":["enkel",110.192,3.904,114.446,5.419],"They grow up so fast, don't they?":["enkel",120.215,2.133,122.698,3.029],"They certainly do!":["enkel",126.077,1.323],"Do you see your grandchildren often?":["enkel",127.75,2.176,130.276,3.051],"Not as often as I'd like, but we talk every week.":["enkel",133.677,2.667],"When I was young, we didn't have a television.":["enkel",136.693,2.432,139.475,3.456],"Neither did we!":["enkel",143.281,1.259],"I can't connect to the Wi-Fi.":["technik",0.3,1.835,2.485,2.624],"Could you help me set it up?":["technik",5.459,1.579,7.387,2.304],"Turn it off and on again.":["technik",10.041,1.685,12.077,2.325],"I need to charge my phone.":["technik",14.752,1.771,16.873,2.496],"The battery has run out.":["technik",19.719,1.664,21.733,2.389],"How do I log in?":["technik",24.472,1.365,26.187,1.963],"I'd like to make a video call to my family.":["technik",28.5,2.325,31.175,3.392],"Could you show me how it works?":["technik",34.917,1.685,36.953,2.475],"Excuse me, I'm afraid I can't connect to the Wi-Fi. Could you help me?":["technik",39.777,4.075,44.202,5.632],"Of course. Have you selected the network called 'Harbour Guest'?":["technik",50.184,3.712,54.246,5.056],"Yes, but then it asks me to log in, and I don't know how.":["technik",59.652,3.008,63.01,4.224],"No problem. Just type in your room number and the password on your key card.":["technik",67.584,5.056,72.99,6.955],"I've done that, but nothing happens.":["technik",80.295,2.005,82.65,2.923],"Let's try turning it off and on again. That usually helps.":["technik",85.923,3.904,90.177,5.419],"Oh, now it works! Thank you so much. Now I can make a video call to my family.":["technik",95.945,4.608,100.903,6.379],"You're welcome. If the battery runs out, there's a charger at reception.":["technik",107.632,4.757,112.739,6.549],"Have you tried turning it off and on again?":["technik",119.639,2.923,122.911,4.139],"Not yet – I'll try that now.":["technik",127.4,1.813],"What's the problem?":["technik",129.563,1.301,131.215,1.771],"My phone won't connect to the Wi-Fi.":["technik",133.335,2.197],"Shall I show you how it works?":["technik",135.883,1.92,138.153,2.645],"Yes, please – that would be very helpful.":["technik",141.148,1.984],"Thank you for inviting me.":["einladung",0.3,1.664,2.314,2.389],"These are for you.":["einladung",5.053,1.301,6.705,1.813],"What a lovely house!":["einladung",8.868,1.408,10.626,2.027],"Can I give you a hand?":["einladung",13.003,1.515,14.867,2.112],"This is absolutely delicious.":["einladung",17.329,1.92,19.599,2.731],"Could I have the recipe?":["einladung",22.68,1.621,24.651,2.368],"I couldn't eat another thing.":["einladung",27.369,1.685,29.405,2.411],"I've had a wonderful evening.":["einladung",32.165,1.749,34.265,2.539],"Hello! Come in, come in. I'm so glad you could make it.":["einladung",37.153,3.371,40.874,4.736],"Thank you for inviting me. These are for you.":["einladung",45.96,2.56,48.87,3.52],"Oh, they're beautiful! You really shouldn't have. Would you like something to drink?":["einladung",52.74,4.203,57.293,5.952],"A cup of tea would be lovely. Can I give you a hand in the kitchen?":["einladung",63.595,3.499,67.443,5.056],"No, no, you're my guest. Sit down and relax. Dinner's almost ready.":["einladung",72.849,4.245,77.445,5.867],"This roast is absolutely delicious. Could I have the recipe?":["einladung",83.661,3.904,87.915,5.376],"Of course – it was my mother's. Would you like some more?":["einladung",93.641,2.837,96.829,4.181],"Thank you, but I couldn't eat another thing. I've had a wonderful evening.":["einladung",101.36,3.861,105.571,5.355],"Would you like some more?":["einladung",111.276,1.6,113.226,2.197],"Just a little, thank you – it's delicious.":["einladung",115.773,2.176],"You really shouldn't have!":["einladung",118.299,1.749,120.399,2.347],"It's just a small thank you.":["einladung",123.095,1.685],"Thank you for coming!":["einladung",125.131,1.429,126.91,2.005],"Thank you for having me – it was lovely.":["einladung",129.265,2.027],"I'd like to make an appointment.":["telefonieren",0.3,1.813,2.463,2.517],"Sorry, could you speak up a little?":["telefonieren",5.331,1.835,7.515,2.517],"Could you repeat that, please?":["telefonieren",10.383,1.664,12.397,2.453],"Would Thursday morning suit you?":["telefonieren",15.2,1.792,17.342,2.624],"That's fine with me.":["telefonieren",20.316,1.28,21.946,1.92],"Shall I spell that for you?":["telefonieren",24.216,1.643,26.209,2.304],"I'm afraid I can't make it.":["telefonieren",28.863,1.813,31.026,2.56],"Thank you for your help. Goodbye!":["telefonieren",33.936,1.899,36.185,2.624],"Good morning, Bath Hair Studio, Emily speaking. How can I help?":["telefonieren",39.159,3.883,43.391,5.461],"Good morning. I'd like to make an appointment for a cut and blow-dry, please.":["telefonieren",49.203,3.947,53.499,5.376],"Certainly. Would Thursday at half past ten suit you?":["telefonieren",59.225,3.029,62.605,4.181],"Sorry, could you speak up a little? The line isn't very good.":["telefonieren",67.136,3.221,70.707,4.587],"Of course. Thursday – at ten thirty.":["telefonieren",75.644,2.389,78.383,3.349],"Ah, Thursday at ten thirty. Yes, that's fine with me.":["telefonieren",82.083,3.307,85.739,4.736],"Lovely. Could I take your surname, please?":["telefonieren",90.825,2.517,93.693,3.52],"Of course. Shall I spell it for you? It's a German name.":["telefonieren",97.563,2.901,100.814,4.16],"Yes, please, that would help. And could I have a phone number in case we need to reach you?":["telefonieren",105.324,4.587,110.261,6.379],"Who's calling, please?":["telefonieren",116.989,1.557,118.897,2.24],"This is Mrs Becker from Germany.":["telefonieren",121.487,2.091],"Would Friday suit you better?":["telefonieren",123.927,1.941,126.219,2.645],"Friday is fine, thank you.":["telefonieren",129.214,1.749],"Could you hold the line for a moment?":["telefonieren",131.313,2.048,133.711,2.987],"Of course, no problem.":["telefonieren",137.048,1.6],"I try to go for a walk every day.":["wohlbefinden",0.3,2.112,2.762,3.008],"You should drink more water.":["wohlbefinden",6.12,1.6,8.07,2.304],"I've been sleeping badly recently.":["wohlbefinden",10.724,2.091,13.165,2.965],"Have you thought about joining a group?":["wohlbefinden",16.48,1.963,18.793,2.88],"It does me a lot of good.":["wohlbefinden",22.023,1.579,23.951,2.304],"I'd like to give it a try.":["wohlbefinden",26.605,1.6,28.555,2.283],"You shouldn't overdo it.":["wohlbefinden",31.188,1.557,33.095,2.155],"I feel much fitter than last year.":["wohlbefinden",35.6,1.963,37.913,2.859],"You're looking well! Have you been doing anything special?":["wohlbefinden",41.121,2.752,44.223,3.925],"Thank you! I try to go for a walk every day. It does me a lot of good.":["wohlbefinden",48.499,3.797,52.646,5.376],"Good for you. I go with a walking group on Tuesdays. Have you thought about joining one?":["wohlbefinden",58.372,4.523,63.245,6.443],"Not yet, but I'd like to give it a try. Are the walks very long?":["wohlbefinden",70.037,3.499,73.886,4.8],"Usually about five kilometres, and we always stop for coffee halfway.":["wohlbefinden",79.036,4.203,83.589,5.845],"That sounds perfect. Although I've been sleeping badly recently, so I'm often tired.":["wohlbefinden",89.784,4.587,94.721,6.528],"Then you shouldn't overdo it at first. But fresh air usually helps you sleep better.":["wohlbefinden",101.599,4.501,106.45,6.293],"That's good advice. I'll come along next Tuesday!":["wohlbefinden",113.093,2.667,116.11,3.712],"You're looking well!":["wohlbefinden",120.172,1.259,121.781,1.728],"Thank you – I've been walking a lot.":["wohlbefinden",123.859,1.856],"I've had a terrible headache all day.":["wohlbefinden",126.065,2.347,128.761,3.328],"Oh dear. Maybe you should lie down for a bit.":["wohlbefinden",132.439,2.411],"Would you like to join us next week?":["wohlbefinden",135.2,2.176,137.726,3.157],"I'd love to – thanks for asking.":["wohlbefinden",141.233,1.877],"I'm going to visit Scotland next summer.":["zukunft",0.3,2.219,2.869,3.328],"I've always wanted to see the Northern Lights.":["zukunft",6.547,2.347,9.243,3.349],"If I have time, I'll take a cooking class.":["zukunft",12.943,2.389,15.682,3.307],"I'm thinking of learning Italian too.":["zukunft",19.339,2.112,21.801,2.965],"I hope the weather will be good.":["zukunft",25.116,1.771,27.237,2.517],"It's never too late to learn something new.":["zukunft",30.104,2.261,32.715,3.285],"I'm really looking forward to it.":["zukunft",36.351,1.92,38.621,2.709],"We'll see.":["zukunft",41.68,1.237,43.267,1.216],"So, what are your plans for next year? Anything exciting?":["zukunft",44.833,3.648,48.831,4.928],"Yes! I'm going to visit Scotland next summer with a friend.":["zukunft",54.109,3.051,57.51,4.331],"Wonderful. Have you ever been there before?":["zukunft",62.191,2.709,65.25,3.733],"Never. But I've always wanted to see the Highlands – and maybe the Northern Lights.":["zukunft",69.333,3.819,73.502,5.184],"You'd need a bit of luck for the Northern Lights. What else is on your list?":["zukunft",79.036,4.693,84.079,6.443],"I'm thinking of learning Italian too. It's never too late to learn something new.":["zukunft",90.872,4.416,95.638,6.165],"I couldn't agree more. I started painting at seventy!":["zukunft",102.153,3.477,105.981,4.843],"How wonderful! Well, I'm really looking forward to my trip. We'll see what happens.":["zukunft",111.173,4.309,115.833,5.931],"I'm thinking of learning Italian.":["zukunft",122.113,1.963],"What are your plans for the weekend?":["zukunft",124.426,2.453,127.229,3.371],"I'm going to visit some friends.":["zukunft",130.95,1.835],"Are you looking forward to your trip?":["zukunft",133.135,2.219,135.703,3.072],"Very much – I can't wait!":["zukunft",139.125,1.707],"Do you think you'll see the Northern Lights?":["zukunft",141.182,2.325,143.857,3.179],"I hope so – but we'll see.":["zukunft",147.386,1.621],"Afternoon tea was introduced in the 1840s.":["tee",0.3,4.181,4.831,5.867],"It's said that the Duchess felt hungry in the afternoon.":["tee",11.048,2.837,14.235,3.968],"It soon became fashionable.":["tee",18.553,1.771,20.674,2.56],"The scones are served with jam and clotted cream.":["tee",23.584,2.645,26.579,3.733],"Which goes on first, the jam or the cream?":["tee",30.663,2.368,33.381,3.435],"People feel very strongly about it.":["tee",37.165,2.133,39.649,3.072],"I'd never have guessed that.":["tee",43.071,1.685,45.106,2.389],"Would you mind if I took a photo?":["tee",47.845,1.941,50.137,2.859],"Welcome! Is this your first proper cream tea?":["tee",53.345,2.816,56.511,3.861],"It is! I've always wondered – where does the tradition of afternoon tea actually come from?":["tee",60.723,4.459,65.531,6.293],"It was introduced in the 1840s by Anna, the Duchess of Bedford. It's said she felt hungry between lunch and dinner, which was served very late in those days.":["tee",72.175,10.347,82.871,14.464],"So she invited friends for tea and cakes in the afternoon?":["tee",97.685,3.008,101.043,4.245],"Exactly, and it soon became fashionable. Now, here in Devon we put the cream on first, then the jam. In Cornwall, they do it the other way round.":["tee",105.639,8.363,114.351,11.563],"Does it really make a difference?":["tee",126.264,1.771,128.385,2.581],"Oh, people feel very strongly about it! Just don't do it the Cornish way in here.":["tee",131.316,4.565,136.231,6.357],"I'd never have guessed that. Would you mind if I took a photo of the table?":["tee",142.939,3.968,147.257,5.781],"Not at all – go ahead!":["tee",153.388,1.707,155.445,2.347],"It is said that she felt hungry.":["tee",158.141,1.92],"Would you mind if I opened the window?":["tee",160.411,2.24,163.001,3.072],"Not at all – go ahead.":["tee",166.423,1.515],"Did you know scones are eaten differently in Cornwall?":["tee",168.288,2.987,171.625,4.075],"No, I'd never have guessed that!":["tee",176.049,1.941],"How do you take your tea?":["tee",178.341,1.643,180.333,2.24],"With a little milk, please, no sugar.":["tee",182.923,2.091],"It's raining cats and dogs.":["redewendungen",0.3,1.813,2.463,2.645],"I'm feeling a bit under the weather.":["redewendungen",5.459,1.835,7.643,2.688],"It was a piece of cake.":["redewendungen",10.681,1.472,12.503,2.155],"It cost an arm and a leg.":["redewendungen",15.008,1.749,17.107,2.539],"We only see each other once in a blue moon.":["redewendungen",19.996,2.304,22.65,3.179],"Let's call it a day.":["redewendungen",26.179,1.387,27.915,2.091],"I'll keep my fingers crossed for you.":["redewendungen",30.356,1.899,32.605,2.731],"It's not my cup of tea.":["redewendungen",35.685,1.685,37.721,2.389],"Sorry I'm late – it's raining cats and dogs out there!":["redewendungen",40.46,3.093,43.903,4.245],"Cats and dogs? I suppose that means it's raining very heavily?":["redewendungen",48.499,3.669,52.518,5.205],"Exactly! And to be honest, I'm feeling a bit under the weather too.":["redewendungen",58.073,3.584,62.007,5.035],"Oh dear, I hope it's nothing serious. How was your driving test, by the way?":["redewendungen",67.392,4.331,72.073,6.059],"A piece of cake! I passed first time. But the lessons cost an arm and a leg.":["redewendungen",78.481,4.523,83.354,6.315],"Congratulations! I'll keep my fingers crossed for your new car, then.":["redewendungen",90.019,3.733,94.102,5.333],"Thanks! Shall we go to the jazz concert on Saturday?":["redewendungen",99.785,3.029,103.165,4.245],"To be honest, jazz isn't really my cup of tea. How about the theatre instead?":["redewendungen",107.76,4.587,112.697,6.4],"How was the exam?":["redewendungen",119.447,1.6,121.397,2.24],"A piece of cake!":["redewendungen",123.987,1.301],"I've got a job interview tomorrow.":["redewendungen",125.638,2.197,128.185,3.029],"Good luck – I'll keep my fingers crossed!":["redewendungen",131.565,2.219],"Shall we stop now? I'm exhausted.":["redewendungen",134.133,2.24,136.723,3.072],"Yes, let's call it a day.":["redewendungen",140.145,1.643],"They said on the radio that the bridge would be closed.":["nachrichten",0.3,2.773,3.423,3.925],"Apparently, there's been a storm warning.":["nachrichten",7.699,2.112,10.161,2.923],"According to the forecast, it'll clear up by Sunday.":["nachrichten",13.433,3.008,16.791,4.16],"The mayor announced that the festival had been postponed.":["nachrichten",21.301,2.901,24.553,3.968],"They advised people to stay indoors.":["nachrichten",28.871,2.283,31.503,3.243],"I heard that the ferry isn't running.":["nachrichten",35.096,2.048,37.494,2.88],"It's hard to say how long it will last.":["nachrichten",40.724,2.176,43.25,3.051],"Let's keep an eye on the news.":["nachrichten",46.651,1.813,48.814,2.624],"Did you hear the news this morning? I missed it.":["nachrichten",51.788,2.987,55.125,4.16],"Yes. Apparently, there's been a storm warning for the whole coast.":["nachrichten",59.635,3.349,63.334,4.565],"A storm? What exactly did they say?":["nachrichten",68.249,2.56,71.159,3.499],"They said that the wind would reach eighty miles an hour tonight, and they advised people to stay indoors.":["nachrichten",75.008,5.717,81.075,7.787],"Goodness. And the festival on Saturday?":["nachrichten",89.212,2.816,92.378,3.947],"The mayor announced that it had been postponed until next weekend.":["nachrichten",96.675,3.264,100.289,4.587],"What a shame. Is the ferry still running?":["nachrichten",105.225,2.752,108.327,3.776],"I heard it isn't running today. But according to the forecast, it'll clear up by Sunday.":["nachrichten",112.453,4.992,117.795,6.827],"Well, let's keep an eye on the news. Thanks for letting me know!":["nachrichten",124.972,3.861,129.183,5.355],"They said that the bridge would be closed.":["nachrichten",134.888,2.176],"According to the forecast, it'll clear up.":["nachrichten",137.414,2.411],"What did the doctor say?":["nachrichten",140.175,1.621,142.146,2.133],"He said I should rest for a few days.":["nachrichten",144.629,2.219],"Is the ferry running today?":["nachrichten",147.198,2.24,149.788,3.072],"Apparently not – because of the storm.":["nachrichten",153.21,2.091],"Thanks for letting me know!":["nachrichten",155.651,1.792,157.793,2.389],"You're welcome – stay safe!":["nachrichten",160.532,1.643],"If I were younger, I'd travel around the world.":["wennich",0.3,2.496,3.146,3.499],"If I had more time, I'd learn to play the piano.":["wennich",6.995,2.752,10.097,3.776],"If I had known, I would have come earlier.":["wennich",14.223,2.155,16.727,3.029],"I wish I had started learning English sooner.":["wennich",20.107,2.432,22.889,3.328],"What would you do if you won the lottery?":["wennich",26.567,1.963,28.879,2.795],"Looking back, I wouldn't change a thing.":["wennich",32.024,2.048,34.422,2.944],"It might have been different.":["wennich",37.716,1.579,39.645,2.283],"Better late than never!":["wennich",42.277,1.515,44.142,2.176],"Tell me – if you could live anywhere in the world, where would you go?":["wennich",46.668,3.989,51.007,5.611],"If I were younger, I'd probably move to Italy. I love the food and the sunshine.":["wennich",56.968,4.736,62.054,6.549],"And is there anything you regret?":["wennich",68.953,2.624,71.927,3.648],"Well, I wish I had started learning English sooner. I'd have understood so much more on my travels.":["wennich",75.925,5.355,81.63,7.531],"Better late than never! Your English is excellent now.":["wennich",89.511,3.541,93.402,4.949],"Thank you. And what would you do if you won the lottery?":["wennich",98.701,2.517,101.569,3.52],"I'd buy a little boat and sail around the Scottish islands. And you?":["wennich",105.439,4.587,110.375,6.357],"I'd invite my whole family on a trip. But looking back, I wouldn't change a thing.":["wennich",117.083,4.437,121.87,6.165],"I wish I had started sooner.":["wennich",128.385,1.792],"What would you do if you had more free time?":["wennich",130.527,2.88,133.757,3.925],"I'd spend more time in my garden.":["wennich",138.033,2.048],"I didn't know you were in town!":["wennich",140.431,2.304,143.085,3.2],"If I'd known, I would have called you.":["wennich",146.635,1.877],"Do you regret anything?":["wennich",148.862,1.749,150.961,2.432],"Not really – I wouldn't change a thing.":["wennich",153.743,2.027],"The castle stands on an extinct volcano.":["edinburgh",0.3,2.389,3.039,3.392],"This is the street where the old town begins.":["edinburgh",6.781,2.453,9.585,3.435],"The festival, which takes place in August, is world-famous.":["edinburgh",13.369,3.371,17.09,4.672],"Is it worth climbing to the top?":["edinburgh",22.112,1.728,24.19,2.603],"How long does it take to get there?":["edinburgh",27.143,1.963,29.455,2.688],"I'd rather take the bus, if that's all right.":["edinburgh",32.493,2.453,35.297,3.52],"Could you tell me when it was built?":["edinburgh",39.167,1.835,41.351,2.624],"That's fascinating!":["edinburgh",44.325,1.451,46.126,2.069],"Welcome to the Royal Mile! Behind me you can see the castle, which stands on an extinct volcano.":["edinburgh",48.545,6.656,55.551,9.045],"A volcano? That's fascinating! Could you tell me when the castle was built?":["edinburgh",64.947,4.032,69.329,5.589],"There's been a castle here for about nine hundred years, although most of the buildings you see today are younger.":["edinburgh",75.268,6.827,82.445,9.6],"And the hill over there – is that a volcano too?":["edinburgh",92.395,2.517,95.262,3.541],"Yes, that's Arthur's Seat. It's a lovely walk, and the view from the top is spectacular.":["edinburgh",99.153,5.568,105.071,7.659],"Is it worth climbing to the top? I'm not sure my knees would agree.":["edinburgh",113.08,3.52,116.95,4.992],"There's a gentler path on the other side. Or you can enjoy the view from Calton Hill, which is much easier.":["edinburgh",122.292,7.019,129.661,9.835],"Calton Hill sounds perfect. And when is the famous festival?":["edinburgh",139.845,3.563,143.758,5.077],"In August – the whole city is full of music, theatre and comedy. It's the largest arts festival in the world.":["edinburgh",149.185,7.509,157.045,10.389],"The castle, which stands on a volcano, is very old.":["edinburgh",167.784,2.88],"Would you like to climb Arthur's Seat?":["edinburgh",171.014,2.411,173.775,3.264],"I'd rather take the easier path, if that's all right.":["edinburgh",177.389,2.773],"Any questions so far?":["edinburgh",180.512,1.899,182.761,2.645],"Yes – could you tell me how old the castle is?":["edinburgh",185.756,2.347],"The festival is the largest in the world.":["edinburgh",188.453,2.944,191.747,4.096],"Really? I'd love to come back in August.":["edinburgh",196.193,2.219],"How long have you been working here?":["garten",0.3,1.877,2.527,2.709],"I've been gardening for over forty years.":["garten",5.587,2.304,8.241,3.179],"The roses are at their best in June.":["garten",11.769,2.133,14.253,3.072],"What's your secret?":["garten",17.675,1.365,19.39,2.027],"It takes a lot of patience.":["garten",21.767,1.685,23.802,2.539],"I've got a small garden myself.":["garten",26.691,2.027,29.067,2.901],"Slugs are a real nuisance.":["garten",32.319,1.835,34.503,2.603],"Would you recommend any plants for a shady spot?":["garten",37.456,2.56,40.366,3.776],"Lovely morning, isn't it? Are you enjoying the garden?":["garten",44.492,3.669,48.511,5.141],"Very much! The roses are breathtaking. How long have you been working here?":["garten",54.003,4.053,58.406,5.632],"I've been working here for twenty-three years. And I've been gardening since I was a boy.":["garten",64.388,5.227,69.965,7.211],"That explains it. What's your secret for such beautiful roses?":["garten",77.525,3.627,81.502,5.141],"Good soil, plenty of water, and a lot of patience. They're at their best in June.":["garten",86.993,5.44,92.783,7.68],"I've got a small garden myself, but the slugs eat everything. They're a real nuisance.":["garten",100.813,4.992,106.155,6.827],"Ah, the gardener's oldest enemy! Try putting crushed eggshells around the plants – it often helps.":["garten",113.332,6.251,119.933,8.683],"I'll try that. Would you recommend any plants for a shady spot?":["garten",128.965,3.499,132.814,4.907],"Ferns and hostas do very well in the shade – although the slugs love hostas too, I'm afraid!":["garten",138.071,6.528,144.949,8.768],"How long have you been learning English?":["garten",154.067,2.475,156.891,3.264],"For a few months now.":["garten",160.505,1.429],"Have you got a garden?":["garten",162.285,1.621,164.256,2.24],"Just a small one, but I love it.":["garten",166.846,1.856],"Try putting eggshells around your plants.":["garten",169.052,2.88,172.282,3.904],"What a good idea – I'll give it a try.":["garten",176.536,2.219],"Sorry, is this the end of the queue?":["britisch",0.3,2.027,2.677,2.816],"It's not bad at all.":["britisch",5.843,1.451,7.643,2.048],"It's a bit chilly today, isn't it?":["britisch",10.041,1.899,12.29,2.731],"I was wondering if you could help me.":["britisch",15.371,1.963,17.683,2.816],"I'm terribly sorry to bother you.":["britisch",20.849,1.92,23.119,2.795],"That's quite interesting.":["britisch",26.264,1.557,28.171,2.155],"With all due respect, …":["britisch",30.676,1.493,32.519,2.091],"No worries at all.":["britisch",34.96,1.408,36.718,1.984],"I'm afraid so! It's not moving very fast. Are you on holiday?":["britisch",39.052,3.648,43.05,5.269],"Yes, from Germany. I've noticed people here apologise a lot – even when it's not their fault.":["britisch",48.669,5.376,54.395,7.467],"Ha! It's true. If you bump into a Brit, they'll say sorry first. It's almost automatic.":["britisch",62.212,5.291,67.853,7.36],"And when someone says a meal is 'not bad', I'm never sure if they liked it.":["britisch",75.563,3.947,79.859,5.483],"'Not bad' usually means it was very good! And 'quite interesting' often means rather boring.":["britisch",85.692,5.12,91.162,7.147],"That's very useful to know. I was wondering – is it rude to ask people about their salary?":["britisch",98.659,4.907,103.915,6.933],"Oh, terribly! Talk about the weather instead – it's always safe.":["britisch",111.199,3.627,115.175,5.12],"Sorry!":["britisch",120.645,1.216,122.211,1.216],"No worries at all!":["britisch",123.777,1.387],"How was the film?":["britisch",125.514,1.515,127.379,2.005],"Not bad at all, actually – I really enjoyed it.":["britisch",129.734,2.752],"Lovely weather today, isn't it?":["britisch",132.836,2.133,135.319,2.944],"Yes, it's glorious! Let's hope it lasts.":["britisch",138.613,2.261],"I'd like to make a complaint about my holiday.":["reklamation",0.3,2.325,2.975,3.328],"We were promised a sea view.":["reklamation",6.653,1.6,8.603,2.283],"The room should have been cleaned every day.":["reklamation",11.236,2.112,13.698,3.029],"I'm afraid that's not good enough.":["reklamation",17.077,1.899,19.326,2.645],"I'd expect at least a partial refund.":["reklamation",22.321,2.219,24.89,3.285],"I'll put it in writing.":["reklamation",28.525,1.6,30.475,2.24],"I appreciate your help.":["reklamation",33.065,1.621,35.037,2.347],"I look forward to hearing from you.":["reklamation",37.733,1.899,39.982,2.709],"Sunshine Holidays, customer service. How can I help?":["reklamation",43.041,3.84,47.231,5.419],"Good morning. I'd like to make a complaint about my holiday in Cornwall last week.":["reklamation",53.0,4.309,57.659,5.973],"I'm sorry to hear that. What seems to have been the problem?":["reklamation",63.983,3.477,67.81,4.864],"We were promised a room with a sea view, but our window looked out onto the car park.":["reklamation",73.024,4.395,77.769,5.952],"I do apologise. Was there anything else?":["reklamation",84.071,3.2,87.621,4.373],"Yes. The room should have been cleaned every day, but it was only cleaned twice.":["reklamation",92.344,3.819,96.513,5.376],"I can offer you a voucher for ten per cent off your next booking.":["reklamation",102.239,4.501,107.09,6.251],"I'm afraid that's not good enough. I'd expect at least a partial refund.":["reklamation",113.691,4.181,118.222,5.824],"I understand. If you put it in writing with some photos, I'll pass it on to my manager straight away.":["reklamation",124.396,6.805,131.551,9.472],"What seems to have been the problem?":["reklamation",141.373,2.155,143.878,2.901],"We were promised a sea view, but we didn't get one.":["reklamation",147.129,2.496],"Can I offer you a voucher?":["reklamation",149.975,2.283,152.608,3.157],"I'm afraid I'd prefer a partial refund.":["reklamation",156.115,2.56],"I'll pass it on to my manager.":["reklamation",159.025,2.496,161.871,3.52],"Thank you – I appreciate your help.":["reklamation",165.741,1.963]}}